# Source constraint for canfar-lab, consumed by `make lock-astroai-lab` / `make lock-canfar-lab`.
#
# Unpinned on purpose: the container TAG is the user-facing version, so the
# image bakes whatever `main` is at lock time (regenerate with
# `make lock-canfar-lab` — never edit the lockfile by hand).
#
# This fork tracks sfabbro/canfar-lab until the lab commit lands on
# astroai/canfar-lab; switch the URL back to astroai when opening an upstream PR.
canfar-lab @ git+https://github.com/sfabbro/canfar-lab.git
